{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/db342da2ea102cfad37342c5fa4a9489.poster.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/db342da2ea102cfad37342c5fa4a9489.webm?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/db342da2ea102cfad37342c5fa4a9489.mp4?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colossal Cave is a classic, <strong>cozy 3D Adventure</strong>; slow down, explore a massive magical, <i>labyrinthine</i> cave system, all while solving clever, sprawling puzzles at your own pace. Auto-magic maps, limited inventory, all the fantastic creatures and a deep mystery at the heart of the experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You <i>may</i> hear its heart beating while approaching the volcano. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/58f11ab5ec86dde33ac6ffe7506b75d4.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person POV</strong> with <strong>classic point-&amp;-click controls</strong>: walk, look, interact, pick things up, and test your theories. <strong>Limited inventory</strong> requires clever management in its own right. A <strong>magical series of maps</strong> quietly track where you\u2019ve been, marking where you\u2019ve dropped items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply focus on solving puzzles instead of wrestling with navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/5aff4b8e5082c4f34ee8420ba6df004f.poster.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/5aff4b8e5082c4f34ee8420ba6df004f.webm?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/5aff4b8e5082c4f34ee8420ba6df004f.mp4?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/36efee7d8136ae4102e17e7246b3af45.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1249 height=145 /></span>This is not a frantic action game; no frenetic timers shouting at you, no combo meters to maintain\u2014just you, your lamp, and a series of intertwined, sprawling, twisty corridors full of brainy, logic-driven challenges.<br><br>Take your time:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try weird solutions. Trial and error can be your friend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double back to old rooms with new ideas and unlock potential new discoveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow that \u201cwhat if I\u2026?\u201d inclination and see what the cave passes back.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/ce90eeae6dc51d8db9f2d7f8454fe828.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave is quiet, but not without your footsteps.<br><br>You\u2019ll bump into:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mischievous dwarves with sharp daggers and sharper tempers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grumpy, red bridge guarding troll.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noticeably absent giant.\u00a0 You see that?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flickering hinkypunks and other odd cave-dwellers. A handsome pirate, perhaps?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasures, strange artifacts, and places that feel just a little <i>too</i> magical to be natural.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/eb67e99ccfc2f8392b6137b9a2fe11eb.poster.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/eb67e99ccfc2f8392b6137b9a2fe11eb.webm?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/eb67e99ccfc2f8392b6137b9a2fe11eb.mp4?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounters are charming, whilst others are just dangerous enough to keep you on your toes\u2014but it all stays firmly in \u201ccasual mystical adventure,\u201d not horror. Just fantasy with a slice of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That said, all good Adventures suggest one should <strong>save early, save often</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/78bbf8361a248df1854612c105bac165.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1249 height=145 /></span>Colossal Cave 3D leans into that <strong>old-school adventure game</strong> atmosphere: colorful environments, shadowy silhouettes, bats, and a focus on exploring the world for clues rather than being led by the nose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/ee5779c876d6796b91588595bf1ee453.poster.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/ee5779c876d6796b91588595bf1ee453.webm?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/ee5779c876d6796b91588595bf1ee453.mp4?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lack of customization allows dialing the game to match your vibe with a variety of options, including comfort tweaks and settings.\u00a0 Snap turns, or nuke the narrator.\u00a0 It's all there. Play exactly how you like\u2014curled up with a controller, a mouse, a headset, or a keyboard, <i>slowly</i> dawdling through the cave one cavern at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/3944cbee735f5c81268933de4b005cdf.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed, point-&amp;-click exploration in a massive cave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory that makes item choices and puzzle routes matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handy auto-map that shows where you\u2019ve been and where you dropped items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of dwarves, elves, hinkypunks, and other quirky cave creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of logic-driven puzzles with satisfying \u201caha!\u201d moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-cool adventure vibes inspired by classic games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible customization options so you can make the adventure as meditative and away as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mythic, mellow <i><strong>cavecation</strong></i>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/da00294cd0d51dd37418a8342d5ece61.poster.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/da00294cd0d51dd37418a8342d5ece61.webm?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/da00294cd0d51dd37418a8342d5ece61.mp4?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture down into Colossal Cave, follow your curiosity, and see how far your lamp \u2014 <i>and your wits</i> \u2014 can take you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"We've Only Just Begun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215540/cc974c98749bd3de165156c661cfc7d773eebc5d.jpg"},{"name":"You're Spelunkin' now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215540/03ab66f688158869edcf2da1630e232b8dc9b387.jpg"},{"name":"Birdman of the Caves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215540/a51ddd26c45d1820f2f83e8bb40788b218a4acd2.jpg"},{"name":"Charmin' the Snake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215540/ba123dababf10b6a655e1e4b8591000d1f848d0b.jpg"},{"name":"Drums in the Deep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215540/f3e8ef10716d315d7e2599d889d4b792ee384fbb.jpg"},{"name":"Can't Bear The Weight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215540/c5da3a2e261cd44c75b245fc74ded48ec357803d.jpg"},{"name":"Take the Scenic Route","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215540/8c15553ebd415c25729703bd97230bacf8523817.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215540/86