et, or a keyboard, <i>slowly</i> dawdling through the cave one cavern at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/3944cbee735f5c81268933de4b005cdf.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1249 height=145 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed, point-&amp;-click exploration in a massive cave</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited inventory that makes item choices and puzzle routes matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handy auto-map that shows where you\u2019ve been and where you dropped items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of dwarves, elves, hinkypunks, and other quirky cave creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of logic-driven puzzles with satisfying \u201caha!\u201d moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-cool adventure vibes inspired by classic games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible customization options so you can make the adventure as meditative and away as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mythic, mellow <i><strong>cavecation</strong></i>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/da00294cd0d51dd37418a8342d5ece61.poster.avif?t=1769647910\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/da00294cd0d51dd37418a8342d5ece61.webm?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/extras/da00294cd0d51dd37418a8342d5ece61.mp4?t=1769647910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture down into Colossal Cave, follow your curiosity, and see how far your lamp \u2014 <i>and your wits</i> \u2014 can take you.</p>","developers":["Cygnus Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215540/fa7457d4fe3a6964343b1fd0b88981baf633e9a9/header.jpg?t=1769647910","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 @2.9 GHz or AMD equivalent / Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> For Oculus headsets it\u2019s recommended to remain in the Oculus OpenXR runtime. Also note, Colossal Cave currently does not support some pre-2019 controllers (especially older Vive controllers [and a few older Windows headsets] with limited buttons).<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Catalina (10.15) and later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any 64-Bit Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or higher (requires Metal)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2215540/1306036843/21ed9c21a0b22edb34591e698149549886473df7/1767397072/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767398950","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2215540/1306036843/21ed9c21a0b22edb34591e698149549886473df7/1767397072/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767398950","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2215540/1306036843/21ed9c21a0